{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35664344\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"评估视频FOG评分的重复性和评定者间一致性，发现FOG表型评分一致性较差，可用于分析不同研究的FOG测量方法是否造成STN相关结果冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35666167\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究STN-DBS长期疗效，但主要结局是日常生活独立性、生活质量及一般运动和非运动功能，未提供FOG或STN神经活动的特异性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35672669\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"前瞻性研究识别PIGD、认知功能、疲劳及DAT摄取等FOG发生预测因素，可作为解释STN-FOG关联异质性的临床分层变量和潜在混杂因素。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35676243\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅评论一般性多脑区运动计划与启动通路，未涉及帕金森病、步态冻结或STN，不能直接回答研究问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35676479\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"PD小鼠实验区分PF→STN运动学习通路与PF→CPu运动控制通路，为理解STN相关环路与运动执行之间的功能分工提供动物机制证据，尽管未直接研究FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35708047\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究外骨骼运动训练对认知和步行耐力的影响，FOG仅作为次要结局且未发现显著组间效应，也没有STN相关证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35720090\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述STAT-ON可穿戴设备对PD运动症状的监测技术，未聚焦FOG或STN神经活动及其关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35721359\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"属于DBS神经技术与神经调控的泛论性社论，缺乏FOG或STN-FOG关系的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35725730\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"在帕金森大鼠中直接记录MC-STN神经活动，揭示STN异常爆发放电、皮层输入反应性及DBS对病理节律和运动障碍的调节，是理解STN神经活动与运动障碍关系的重要机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35725857\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过FOG患者脑灌注成像发现丘脑、尾状核及顶叶异常，为FOG涉及基底节-丘脑-皮层分布式网络而非单一STN异常提供替代机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35726118\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较FOG与非FOG患者的注意焦点效应，证明注意策略能够差异性改变FOG患者的步态和训练结局，为认知控制及运动自动化障碍机制提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35729546\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"提出基于多传感器的FOG客观识别方法并报告检测性能，可用于理解FOG事件量化和测量方法差异对STN相关研究结果的影响。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35753016\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"VAChT-PET研究发现丘脑等胆碱能网络缺损与FOG独立相关，支持非多巴胺能及前庭感觉整合障碍参与FOG的竞争性机制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35756075\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述区分OFF、ON及治疗抵抗性FOG，并分析持续多巴胺替代治疗效果，有助于将FOG亚型和药物状态作为解释STN-DBS疗效差异的重要调节因素。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35795259\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"专题社论从运动神经控制网络、FOG病理生理及神经生理测量和治疗方法等角度提供整体框架，有助于将STN置于更广泛的运动控制网络中理解。【turn739351search0】\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35798568\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述明确讨论STN-DBS的运动疗效及其对严重轴性症状、步态障碍和跌倒的局限，是解释STN刺激与FOG疗效不一致的重要临床证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35805505\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究骑行双任务训练对PD认知和一般身体功能的影响，未提供FOG特异性结果或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35821845\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述通用DBS设备硬件、智能闭环控制和电池技术，缺乏PD冻结步态或STN特异性神经机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35844275\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究核心是左旋多巴剂量起始期运动恶化，而非FOG或STN神经活动与FOG的关系，相关性仅为间接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35854141\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论PD不同运动亚型的黑质神经病理及PIGD相关环路，未直接研究FOG或STN神经活动，不能直接回答研究问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35862217\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"荟萃分析显示重复经颅磁刺激能够改善FOG，为皮层网络参与FOG及非STN脑区调节FOG提供干预证据，有助于比较竞争性神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35875794\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"DTI研究直接比较FOG与非FOG患者的结构网络，发现额叶、扣带、尾状核和SMA连接异常，为FOG的分布式脑网络机制提供影像学证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35880105\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"观点文章直接联系FOG、STN及皮层-基底节网络β振荡，并讨论神经反馈和运动自动化机制，可提供值得检验的理论假说，尽管缺乏直接临床验证。【turn851983search3】\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35897995\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统调查涵盖PD可穿戴技术的多个应用领域，但未针对FOG的STN神经活动或相关病理机制提供具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35905719\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"小鼠实验直接操控M2→STN通路并揭示其通过PPN调节视觉引导运动，为STN参与运动启动、停止及步行控制提供环路机制证据，具有理解FOG的转化价值。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2bfa993b-4974-4b52-95e3-9e9e84f0a504", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T155340728062Z", "elapsed_seconds": 353.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:59:34.135851+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "415e48abaf848f81e208bebadb5ebc524cc38592f0a99564e9384f7121885f30", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T155340728062Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3a94980e80ab015e9f4cd694d61c8fe93fb48ebd872ba67ae8f7fc8122248baa"}}}
